# Milestone Tasks

## Structure

```
steps/milestone_N/
  instruction.md    # Milestone N prompt only (M1 includes task context)
  tests/test.sh, test_mN.py   # class TestMilestoneN
  solution/solve.sh, solveN.sh
```

No root `instruction.md`, `tests/`, `solution/`, or `milestone_x.md`.

## task.toml

- `number_of_milestones` = `[[steps]]` count (≥ 2)
- `[[steps]].name` = `milestone_1`, `milestone_2`, … (matches directory names)
- Per-milestone `[steps.agent]` and `[steps.verifier]` — **no** top-level `[agent]`/`[verifier]`
- `[environment].workdir` recommended (shared container)

## Rules

- Each milestone is prerequisite for the next (no leaky milestones)
- Files persist across milestones — reset paths in solveN.sh if needed
- 2–5 milestones ideal
- Rubric: 10–40 positive pts per milestone; `# Rubric N` headers

See `docs/guidelines/milestones.md`. Milestone tasks preferred for new submissions.
